<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten pellets flat-higher, meal flat.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten pellets flat-higher, meal flat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten pellets were flat to higher Wednesday and meal values were unchanged, dealers said. One Chicago dealer was out of gluten meal, so no prices for that market were available.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today	 Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -     unq   -   unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   78.00     75.00N</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -     unq    340.00N</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLIINTON</p>
<p>AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   73.00     73.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
